{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S05这类短段仍有较多未定时出现的感受词，容易让细节争夺注意力，Y在快速扫读上更轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的关键句有明显视觉锚点，观众不必逐字读完，就能抓住人物每一阶段的动作、顾虑和心理转折；感受词也提供了更多具体的身体反应、空间体验和音乐变化，部分还与乐句同步，细腻度更高。Y的优势是叙事集中、信息相对轻便，尤其适合快速扫读；但X让人物为什么犹豫、为什么高兴、为什么又害怕失去，变得更容易理解。两版的整体故事走向都能成立，X略胜在局部心理与音乐感受的对应，而不是故事本身更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "77783bc0-378b-4af8-ae87-7fab91882c5e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231203163524Z", "elapsed_seconds": 86.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:13:29.606579+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "52be30dcac1b2ed4931dc371801e344c46213d2b624853bf1af4691861f9a831", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we